It is the month of March.
It is very hot in Kochi.
I am a software engineer.
I work for a long time every day.
I like to play sports in my free time.
I like to play badminton very much.
I can play badminton well.
I played a lot in Mexico.
Now I want to play in Kochi.
I take my phone.
I search for a badminton club in Kochi.
There is a big sports center in Kaloor.
It is an indoor stadium.
It is near my flat.
The distance is only two kilometers.
I am going to walk there.
I put on my sports shoes.
I walk along the road.
I am very happy to play again today.
